  "title": "· BALENCIAGA Hourglass Avenue Small Bag ·",
  "original_title": "BALENCIAGA Hourglass Avenue 小号手袋",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga’s Winter 26 Hourglass Avenue handbag blends its iconic hourglass shape with vintage doctor bags in glossy calfskin and a minimalist brass clasp.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-11-25",
