    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga's Winter 26 collection introduces the new Hourglass Avenue handbag, inspired by the brand's iconic hourglass silhouette and vintage doctor bags. Crafted from lustrous Box calfskin with a minimalist brass magnetic clasp, the curved base echoes the cinched waist of a corset, reinterpreting haute couture's classic tailoring through a contemporary lens.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Design Inspiration ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/02eda1199e2e7849.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/4ca33d752bb26388.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Hourglass Avenue handbag made its debut at the Balenciaga Winter 26 show, a collection designed by former creative director Pierpaolo Piccioli and inspired by the chiaroscuro art of the High Renaissance, reshaping Balenciaga's classic silhouettes in a contemporary vocabulary. The architectural structure of the outerwear and bags creates a romantic tension between dark and light, envelopment and lightness.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Balenciaga Winter 26 show (swipe left/right for more images)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/d7f98399fd1ce904.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/77e9bfba332c98fd.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag elegantly reimagines the classic Hourglass silhouette, inspired by founder Cristóbal Balenciaga's signature Basque waist, with a curved base and architectural lines that lend it an avant-garde feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
