          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The body is made from specially treated Box calfskin that maintains a structured shape while feeling supple to the touch. The flap design is inspired by the classic doctor bag, combining elegance with everyday practicality.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/82b28d53806f8c7e.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/1707df36e123f149.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This small Hourglass Avenue handbag is rendered in pristine snow white, with glossy Box calfskin exhibiting an oil-painting-like sheen that makes the bag resemble a fine sculptural artwork.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/bd549758389750cb.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4ryqpce/fe263143008ea173.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Brass Magnetic Clasp ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The sleek gold horizontal bar magnetic clasp serves as the bag's focal point, engraved with the BALENCIAGA logo and the inscription 10 Avenue George V, a tribute to the historic address of the brand's haute couture atelier at 10 Avenue George V in Paris—also the source of the bag's name.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
