    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The substantial antiqued brass lock harmonizes with the bag's architectural lines. The magnetic closure allows for one-handed operation—simply lift the flap to open, and close it to hear a crisp metallic click.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
