    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The interior is lined in soft nappa lambskin. A spacious single compartment maximizes capacity, while a zipped pocket holds credit cards or important documents, and a flat back pocket stows phone, keys, and other small essentials.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
