    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The small Hourglass Avenue handbag still offers ample storage. Its 10cm-wide base accommodates thicker items like a wallet, thermos, or compact powder. The supple silhouette is more expandable than the classic Hourglass and lighter in weight. We filled it with a notebook, tissues, phone, wallet, cardholder, earphones, perfume, and keys—and there was still room to spare.",
